---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Chester Beard — GaiaVerity" desc="Chester Beard is the founder and writer behind GaiaVerity.">

  <section style="background:#f7f5f0; padding:72px 24px 96px;">
    <div style="max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
        <div style="width:88px; height:88px; border-radius:999px; background:#eef4f0; border:1px solid #d8e5dc; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-shrink:0;">
          <span class="font-sans" style="font-size:28px; font-weight:700; color:#5c7962;">CB</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-sans" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c98633; margin-bottom:8px;">Founder &amp; Writer</p>
          <h1 class="font-sans" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#23312b;">Chester Beard</h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="font-serif" style="font-size:17px; line-height:1.85; color:#23312b;">

        <p>I started GaiaVerity because I kept running into the same problem: most gardening advice online is either too generic to be useful or too buried in jargon to act on. I wanted a place that tells you what actually works in a real backyard — with real soil, real shade, and a real budget.</p>

        <p>I've spent years working with plants and the people who grow them, learning the hard way which "sure things" actually pan out and which ones fall apart the moment conditions get real. That experience shapes everything published here: we test, we research, and we're honest about what we don't know.</p>

        <p>My goal is simple: help you grow a yard that works <em>with</em> your land instead of against it — less water, fewer chemicals, and more life in the soil.</p>

      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:40px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid #d8e5dc;">
        <a href="/blog/" class="font-sans" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#3B6D11; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">
          Read the latest guides
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
